# Vocabulary, so the screens read as one voice with the till's own app:
#   till       caisse          door     porte
#   reader     lecteur         deposit  consigne
#   cashier    personne en caisse       takings  recette
#   journal    journal         credit note      avoir
#
# Regenerate after changing a translatable string:
#   django-admin makemessages -l fr -i 'static/*' -i 'migrations/*'
# run from pretix_openpos/, then recompile the catalogue next to it:
#   msgfmt -o locale/fr/LC_MESSAGES/django.mo locale/fr/LC_MESSAGES/django.po
# Both files are committed; a test compares them, so a .po edited on its
# own fails rather than shipping yesterday's wording.
