#: templates/pretix_openpos/drawer.html:128
msgid ""
"An archived drawer leaves the list and is offered to no till; every evening "
"above stays here to read, and it can be brought back. A drawer that has been "
"opened cannot be deleted: its ledger and the sales filed under it are part "
"of the books."
msgstr ""
